SUMMARY:Clinical Genomes Scotland Meeting
LOCATION:Royal College of Physicians of Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:A forum to consider and inform the opportunities and challenges of implementing clinical genomics in Scottish healthcare. Discuss genome sequencing technology, genome-based testing for patient care, genomic data and IT systems, innovation pathways. Registration free for University researchers and NHS staff. Registration opens in July.
